    galleryTitle: 'Gallery',
    galleryAlts: ['Technical Jiu-Jitsu class', 'Two women training Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu', 'Young people practising martial arts', 'No-Gi and grappling training', 'Detail of a gi control technique', 'Class sharing an explanation on the mat'],
